   "subject": "Re: directing lavaan to data on a mac",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>May I suggest using the file.choose() function. To put the file path and name into an object called fname:</div><div><br></div><div>fname&lt;-file.choose()</div><div><br></div><div>Executing this line will open a standard file navigation dialog. Navigate to your data file and select it, and that will put the file path and name into the fname object, which you can then use in your &quot;read&quot; statement.</div><div><br></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
