     1,
     "<div><div><div dir=\"auto\">Hello!</div></div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Mark, Edward and Chris - you are the best! I am a newbie at both R and lavaan, and so I appreciate you clarifying things for me.</div></div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">The syntax statements that worked on my Mac laptop were:</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">gssdata &lt;- read.table (“/Users/gjh2293/Downloads/Text-Files-for-R/gss2014_names.txt”, header=T)</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">gssdata &lt;- read.table (“~/Downloads/Text-Files-for-R/gss2014_names.txt”, header=T)</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">getwd()</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">gave me the exact location plus I appreciated learning about </div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">file.choose ()</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Yes, this is more of an R question, so I am all the more grateful to you for answering on the lavaan site.</div><div dir=\"auto\">Again, many thanks!</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Lois</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Wed, Feb 20, 2019 at 1:16 PM Christopher David Desjardins &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">cddesj...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div></div></div>"
